      {
        "index": 1,
        "text": "After the wedding, my cousin and his wife went to the United Kingdom for nationwide sightseeing. He faxed a letter to me in English yesterday. To my delight, he no longer made any tense error.",
        "zh": "婚礼之后，我的表亲和他的妻子到英国各地观光。昨天，他给我传真了一封英文信。让我高兴的是，他不再犯时态错误了。",
        "start": 5.293333333333333,
        "voiceEnd": 21.89,
        "end": 38.486666666666665,
