      {
        "index": 2,
        "text": "And his description roughly clarified my questions about the UK--its currency, its administration, the institution which divides it into four constituent countries, and the historical conflicts and quarrels when Southern Ireland broke away from the UK. Unwilling to leave out any attraction, my cousin arranged his enjoyable journey carefully. One attractive place he visited was a castle in the countryside of Scotland, which lies near a port.",
        "zh": "他的描述也大致解答了我对英国的疑问——包括英国的货币，行政管理，以及由四个构成国组成的制度，还有历史上的冲突与争端，即南爱尔兰脱离英国时发生的那些事。因为不想遗漏任何景点，我的表亲仔细安排了这次愉快的旅行。他参观的一处迷人景点，是苏格兰乡间的一座城堡，位于一个港口附近。",
        "start": 38.486666666666665,
